---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { caseStudies } from '../data/case-studies';
---
<Layout
  title="Paid Search Leadership & Senior Performance Marketing"
  description="Explore Kseniia Shermin's paid search leadership, team management, acquisition systems, and verified results for full-time and fractional opportunities."
>
  <section class="employer-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">FOR HIRING MANAGERS</p>
    <h1>Paid search leadership.<br />Hands-on performance experience.</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">10+ years in paid search and paid social, with experience managing over $100,000 in daily ad spend. My background combines Director of Marketing and Head of PPC responsibilities with the account work, tracking, and reporting behind acquisition growth.</p>
    <p>Considering a Head of Growth, Paid Search Director, or Senior Performance Marketing Manager? Explore my work in lead generation, multi-platform acquisition, team development, and measurement.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/contact/?interest=Full-time%20%2F%20fractional%20role" class="btn btn-primary">Discuss a role &rarr;</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kseniiashermin/" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View LinkedIn &nearr;</a>
      <a href="/about/#career" class="text-link">Full career history &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE IN PRACTICE</p>
    <h2>What I've been responsible for.</h2>
    <div class="split-cards">
      <article class="split-card">
        <h3>Multi-channel acquisition</h3>
        <p>At P7 Ventures, I led paid search strategy across business units, managed vendors, and worked toward CPA and volume targets. For iHealthQuotes, I optimized Google Ads and launched Microsoft Ads and other PPC platforms.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/case-studies/#case-1">See the iHealthQuotes case &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="split-card">
        <h3>Team development</h3>
        <p>At Excel™, I recruited, trained, and managed a team of PPC specialists while managing insurance lead and call generation across six verticals.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/case-studies/#case-3">See the insurance account scope &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="split-card">
        <h3>Acquisition infrastructure</h3>
        <p>For Riverhouse Wellness, I built performance marketing infrastructure, conversion tracking, and data pipelines from scratch using CallTrackingMetrics, Salesforce, and n8n.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/case-studies/#case-2">See the launch work &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="split-card">
        <h3>Reporting for decisions</h3>
        <p>My work includes automated pipelines for real-time ROI tracking and a Power BI analytics system built from scratch, including the data model and reports used for marketing and management decisions.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/case-studies/#case-4">See the e-commerce case &rarr;</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">VERIFIED ACCOUNT RESULTS</p>
    <h2>Different challenges. Specific outcomes.</h2>
    <div class="split-cards">
      {caseStudies.map((cs, index) => <article class="split-card">
        <h3>{cs.name}</h3>
        <p>{cs.result}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`/case-studies/#case-${index + 1}`}>Context and contribution &rarr;</a>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">HOW I WOULD APPROACH A NEW ROLE</p>
    <h2>Establish the foundation, then prioritize growth.</h2>
    <p>The priorities would depend on your business, team, and account maturity. This is the approach I would bring to that first conversation.</p>
    <ol class="approach-list">
      <li><strong>Agree on the business outcome.</strong> Understand the growth goal, lead-quality requirements, and constraints with the team.</li>
      <li><strong>Check the measurement.</strong> Review conversion tracking and reporting before using account data to guide investment.</li>
      <li><strong>Choose the next experiments.</strong> Prioritize account structure, bidding, audience, creative, and landing-page opportunities against the goal.</li>
      <li><strong>Make decisions visible.</strong> Establish a clear view of performance, test results, and next actions.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-cta">
    <h2>Let's discuss the team and the opportunity.</h2>
    <p>Share the role, the acquisition challenge, and what success would look like. You can also read my complete career history and colleague recommendations.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/contact/?interest=Full-time%20%2F%20fractional%20role" class="btn btn-primary">Start a hiring conversation &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-secondary">Background &amp; recommendations &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
 .employer-intro { max-width: 900px; }
 .intro-copy { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
 .cta-buttons { align-items: center; }
 .split-card p { color: var(--color-muted); }
 .approach-list { padding-left: 1.5rem; max-width: 850px; }
 .approach-list li { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-left: .5rem; }
</style>
